abstract: "Installable meta-skill (skills/skill-onboarding/SKILL.md) and zero-dependency Python 3 state helper that pairs with skill-creator to safely probe newly installed or newly built AI Agent Skills in the user's environment and generate a concise one-page cheat sheet (usage card) surfacing hidden commands, missing dependencies, and copyable prompts."
